WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.210 line:85%
I helped the first people ever land on another world!

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.402 line:85%
I'm the bottom half of Eagle, Apollo 11's lunar module.

3
00:00:08.492 --> 00:00:17.340 line:85%
On July 20, 1969, I carried Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin down to the Moon's Sea of Tranquility.

4
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:21.638 line:85%
Near me, they set up a seismometer and a laser reflector.

5
00:00:21.728 --> 00:00:28.036 line:85%
When it was time to go home, I became the launch platform for my top half, and I was left behind.

6
00:00:28.126 --> 00:00:29.889 line:85%
I'm still on the Moon today.

7
00:00:29.979 --> 00:00:33.632 line:85%
If you landed on the Moon, what would you do first?
